<title>USA: Inland Resources 1996 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Inland Resources 1996 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.37     loss	 $0.63</p>
<p> Net	 profit	 2,145     loss	 1,934</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,276		    3,071</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company says the 1995 results include a $500,000, $0.16 per share, charge for discountinued operations and a $216,000, or $0.07.</p>
<p>The earnings per share for 1996 include a $214,000 reduction to net income representing the dividend component of the cash redemption of the Series A preferred stock.</p>
<p>The earnings per share and net income for 1995 have been adjusted to reflect the company's 1-for-10 reverse stock split on June 3, 1996.</p>
</text>
